# This directory holds shared/reusable React components.
#
# Suggested sub-directories:
#   ui/        — Primitive UI components (Button, Input, Badge, Modal…)
#   layout/    — Layout components (Navbar, Sidebar, Footer…)
#   admin/     — Admin-specific components (DataTable, ContentEditor…)
#   public/    — Public-facing components (ArticleCard, Hero…)
